  "verseCount": 55,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo elukha Labani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aulila ali ba okhwa Labani baaba baloma bali, “Yakobo abukule bia paapa bioosi, ne khukhwama khu bia paapa anyooleelekho kimiaandu kino kioosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi Yakobo abona ali Labani se alamulolanga bulayi nga ne aaba mu khurakikha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yakobo ali, “Kobola mu sibala sie bapaapa bowo ne balebe bowo, mala ndaba ne nawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo arumania mala alaanga Raeli ne Lea mu lukoongo nimwo kiminyele kiewe kiaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababoolela ali, “Naboone ndi paapa wenywe se alandolanga bulayi nga mu khurakikha tawe. Ne kakhali Wele owa paapa wase abeele ne nase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mumanyile muli nakholela paapa wenywe ne kamaani kase koosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne paapa wenywe ambeyile ne khukaluukhasia kumuruungo kwase kamakhabi ekhumi, ne kakhali Wele se amuelesia kumunwa khukhumbumisia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaaba bali aaloma ali, ‘bibiaayo bie kamapala bilaba kumuruungo kwowo,’ kumunyele kwosi kwasaala bie kamapala. Ne aloma ali, ‘Bibiaayo bie chinjululusi bilaba kumuruungo kwowo,’ kumunyele kwosi kwasaala bie chinjululusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungila yino Wele abukula bibiaayo bia paapa wenywe mala amba ese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu ndaalo nicho kumunyele kwelukhilamo nabona mu marooro chindurume chichaoona kiminyele chaba ching'enda, che kamapala ne chimelamela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio malaika owa Wele anaanga mu marooro ali, ‘Yakobo’, mala nakobosia ndi, ‘Yee!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala aloma ali, ‘Suta chimoni mala obone, chindurume choosi chilikho ne chioona kiminyele chili ching'enda, che kamapala, ne chimelamela, sikila naboone koosi niko Labani alakhukholelanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.18+GEN.28.19+GEN.28.20+GEN.28.21+GEN.28.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lir. 28.18-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ese ndi Wele owa Beteli, niio wachukha kamafura khu njeko mala wanjichubila. Nono yinyokha, orure mu sibala sino okobole mu sibala nisio wasaalwamo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Raeli ne Lea bakobosia Yakobo bali, “Sisiindu siosi siosi namwe kumukabwa kwaramiile khwifwe mu nju eya paapa ku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se akhubalaanga efwe nga baakwa busa? Sikila akhukusia, mala aarumikhira chirupia nicho bamua khwifwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimiaandu kiosi nikio Wele abukula paapa wefwe kili kikiefwe ne babaana befwe, nono, khola niko Wele akhubooleele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yakobo enyokha, mala aniinia babaana bewe ne bakhasi bewe khu ngamia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala aloonda bibiaayo biewe bioosi ne buli siindu nisio anyoola mu sibala sia Padani-aramu. Arekukha akobole mu sibala sia Kanaani khu raraawe Isaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani aaba achiile khukhala bufuumbo bwe kamakheese kewe, mala Raeli eba bifwaani bie bawele be munju mwa raraawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo abacha Labani Omusiami sikila se amuboolelakho ali, enya khukhwilukha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elukha ne bibiindu bioosi nibio aaba nabio, akhola khangu ambukha luluuchi lwa Efurati mala acha e sibala sie bikulu sia Kileati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Labani atimaka khu Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo ekhola khataru Labani aboolelwa ali Yakobo elukhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abukula balebe bewe mala amutimakho khulwe chindaalo saba, amuloondakho enyuma khukhwola nga amunyoolela mu bikulu bia Kileati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Wele echa khu Labani Omusiami, mu marooro, mu siilo, mala amuboolela ali, “Yiyaya okhakhola orio waloma Yakobo likhuwa lilayi namwe libi tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani ola khu Yakobo. Yakobo aaba asimiikhe liiema liewe mu sibala sie bikulu, ne Labani ne balebe bewe bombakha mu sibala sie bikulu sia Kileati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani aboolela Yakobo ali, “Siina nisio ukholeele, wambeyile, mala wabukula bakhaana base nga baambe be mwiie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siina sikila ne wilukha mu bwikisi, ne umbea, mala se umboolela tawe, andi nakhulekhuulile ne liliekhoya ne kimienya kie chitamburini ne kamatuungu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne siina sikila ne okhandekhile nekwayila babechukhulu base ne babaana base nio? Nono wakholile ke busilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi ne bunyali khu khukholakho libi. Ne kakhali Wele owa raraao alomalome khwise siilo ali, ‘Yiyaya okhakhola orio waloma Yakobo likhuwa libi namwe lilayi tawe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono warekuukhe sikila wekoombile lukali enju eya raraao. Ne siina sikila ne webile bifwaani bie bawele base?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akobosia Labani ali, “Sikila naba ne buuri, ndi onyala wanuula bakhaana bowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesi yesi niye olanyoola ne ali ne bifwaani bie bawele bowo, aleerwa. Ebweeni we balebe befwe yekesia nisio ese ndi nasio sili sisiowo mala osibukule.” Ne Yakobo se amanya ali Raeli aaba ebile bifwaani bie bawele ba Labani tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Labani engila mu liiema lia Yakobo ne mu liiema lia Lea, ne mumaeema ka nasioobi babili, ne se abinyoolamo tawe. Arura mu liiema lia Lea mala engila mu lia Raeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raeli aaba abukule bifwaani bie bawele be munju mwa raraawe abireere mu masisinwe ke engamia mala abiikhalekho. Labani apula mu liiema mwoosi, mala khubinyoola tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raeli aboolela raraawe ali, “omwami okhaambwa lirima, sikila se enyala nakhwinyokhela tawe, ndi mu ndaalo chase chimbi.” Nio apula mala khunyoola bifwaani bie bawele be munju mwewe tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yakobo naye aambwa lirima mala akhalalila Labani. Yakobo amureeba ali, “Bubi bwase buli siina? Bubwonaki bwase buli siina bukilile wandimakakho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhaba ne opulile mu biindu biase bioosi, wanyoolilemo siina khu bioosi bie munju mwowo? Sire ebweeni we balebe base ne babowo, mala bakhalake akari wowo ne nase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimiiko kamakhumi kabili nikio nabele ne nawe, kamakheese kowo ne chimbusi se chauusiakho tawe, ne se naliakho kamamiiku ke muminyele kiowo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisiaayo nisio esolo yeera, se nakhurereranga tawe samwene nakhuruunganga. Wandeebanga khuruunge siakhaba ne siebwa kumuusi namwe siilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naba ndio, kumuumu kwanjosia kumuusi, ne siilo embeo yambwelakho mala liilo liimbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimiiko kamakhumi kabili kano naba munju yowo. Nakhukholela kimiiko ekhumi na kine khulwe khuyila bakhaana bowo babili ne kimiiko sita khulwe kumuruungo kwe lituuli liowo. Mala wakaluukhasia kumuruungo kwase khukhwola ekhumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanga bali Wele owa paapa wase, Wele owa Aburahamu ne buuri bwa Isaaka khu Wele, se bwabeele lubeka lwase tawe, ng'ali ewe andi umboonile busa makhono mataaka. Ne Wele abone kumunaanio kwase ne kimilimo kiase mala siilo sia luno ekhurafwiriire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liuliilisiana lia Yakobo ne Labani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani akobosia Yakobo ne aloma ali, “Bakhaana bali bakhaana base ne babaana bali babaana base, ne kiminyele kili kiminyele kiase, ne bioosi nibio obona bino bili bibiase. Ne kakhali endaalo yino nyala nakhola siina khu bakhaana base bano namwe khu baana babwe nibo basaala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yiicha, ese ne nawe khukhole endakaano mala ebe buloli akari wowo ne nase.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yakobo abukula libaale mala alisimikha nga enjeko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala aboolela balebe bewe ali, “Buusia kamabaale.” Babuusia kumweeka kumuboofu kwe kamabaale mala balia siakhulia amweeka ao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani atiuukhao lisina ali, Yakari-saatuta",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31.47",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yakari-saatuta:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sifuno sie lisina lino mu Luaramaiki sili “Situuta sie khukhukhebusia efwe.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ne Yakobo atiuukhao ali Kaleeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani aboolela Yakobo ali, “Kumweeka kwe kamabaale kuno kuli buloli akari wowo ne nase endaalo eya luno.” Khwako akutiuukha ali Kaleeti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31.48",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kaleeti:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sifuno sie lisina lino mu Lueburania sili “situuta sie khukhukhebusia efwe.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne enjeko akilaanga ali Misipa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31.49",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Misipa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lisina lino lilomekha nga lie Lueburania liliekesia “Abuundu e khukhwima ne khulola.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", sikila aloma ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alikhuloleelela ewe ne nase mu biise nibio khukhali alala tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaba ne upia siibi bakhaana base namwe waaba ne oyila bakhasi babaandi otube khu bakhaana base, aakhaba bali omundu se ali ne nafwe tawe, khebulila oli Wele ali omuloli akari wowo ne nase.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani atasakho ali, “Lola kumweeka kwe kamabaale ne enjeko nibio simiikhe akari wowo ne nase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumweeka kuno ne enjeko yino bili buloli: ese se endibira kumweeka niche khwiwe khurangane tawe, ne ewe wesi se olibira kumweeka kuno ne njeko yino wiche khwise undangane tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele owa Aburahamu ne Wele owa Naori Wele owe bapaapa babwe, abe omukhalaki akari wefwe.” Nio Yakobo echuba ne Buuri bwa raraawe Isaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:54"
          },
